1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,984
Plot z equals x plus i y as the point x, y on the Argand diagram: real axis across, imaginary axis up.

2
00:00:08,984 --> 00:00:10,677
Now describe it differently.

3
00:00:10,677 --> 00:00:17,265
Its distance from the origin is the modulus, r, root of x squared plus y squared.

4
00:00:17,265 --> 00:00:21,718
Its angle from the positive real axis is the argument, theta.

